umber">A world from a number</a><em>3 of 3</em></li><li class="done"><span class="cc-n">ii</span><a href="#explorer-land">The Land</a><em>6 of 6</em></li><li class="done"><span class="cc-n">iii</span><a href="#explorer-strand">The Strand</a><em>4 of 4</em></li><li class="done"><span class="cc-n">iv</span><a href="#explorer-hand">The Hand</a><em>6 of 6</em></li><li class="done"><span class="cc-n">v</span><a href="#explorer-glass">The Surveyor's Glass</a><em>6 of 7<span class="cc-away">one on a tablet</span></em></li><li class="begun"><span class="cc-n">vi</span><a href="#explorer-places">Places on the chart</a><em>2 of 4</em></li><li class="none"><span class="cc-n">vii</span><a href="#explorer-press">The Press</a><em>0 of 3</em></li><li class="none"><span class="cc-n">viii</span><a href="#explorer-table">The Chart Table</a><em>0 of 4</em></li></ol><p class="cc-go"><a href="#explorer-take-road">Go on at vi · Places on the chart</a></p></div>","caption":"Every room that teaches, and how far you have come: a red seal is a lesson done, a red rim one begun, the red road is the way you have come; the lit room is the one you are reading, and the hand points at your next step.","seat":"head","cardLeft":"0","cardTop":"0","foldWidth":"52rem"};
  if (P.seat === "none") return "none";
  const style = document.createElement("style");
