ef="#seed-of-the-day"><text class="name" x="486" y="83.6" style="font-size:12px;text-anchor:middle">The Seed of the Day</text></a><a class="col-way begun" href="#seed-of-the-day-hunt"><circle cx="486" cy="96" r="6.4"/><text x="486" y="98.7">i</text><title>i · The Daily Hunt</title></a></g><g class="col-place isle lone"><a href="#gallery"><text class="name" x="500" y="307.6" style="font-size:12px;text-anchor:middle">The Gallery</text></a><a class="col-way done" href="#gallery-browse"><circle cx="500" cy="320" r="6.4"/><text x="500" y="322.7">i</text><title>i · Worlds hung for viewing</title></a></g><g class="col-next"><circle class="ring-a" cx="319.8" cy="214.4" r="8.3"/><circle class="ring-b" cx="319.8" cy="214.4" r="8.3"/><text transform="translate(326.8 220.9) rotate(43)" text-anchor="start" dy="0.36em">&#x261C;</text></g><g class="col-rose" transform="translate(542 376)"><circle r="12"/><path d="M0 -12 L2.8 -2.8 L12 0 L2.8 2.8 L0 12 L-2.8 2.8 L-12 0 L-2.8 -2.8 Z"/><text y="-16">N</text></g><text class="col-title" x="47" y="392">A Chart of the Lessons</text></svg>","card":"<div class="col-card"><p class="cc-verb">Eight lessons at</p><p class="cc-name">The Explorer</p><ol><li class="done"><span class="cc-n">i</span><a href="#explorer-number">A world from a number</a><em>3 of 3</em></li><li class="done"><span class="cc-n">ii</span><a href="#explorer-land">The Land</a><em>6 of 6</em></li><li class="done"><span class="cc-n">iii</span><a href="#explorer-strand">The Strand</a><em>4 of 4</em></li><li class="done"><span class="cc-n">iv</span><a href="#explorer-hand">The Hand</a><em>6 of 6</em></li><li class="done"><span class="cc-n">v</span><a href="#explorer-glass">The Surveyor's Glass</a><em>6 of 7<span class="cc-away">one on a tablet</span></em></li><li class="begun"><span class="cc-n">vi</span><a href="#explorer-places">Places on the chart</a><em>2 of 4</em></li><li class="none"><span class="cc-n">vii</span><a href="#explorer-press">The Press</a><em>0 of 3</em></li><li class="none"><span class="cc-n">viii</span><a href="#explorer-table">The Chart Table</a><em>0 of 4</em></li></ol><p class="cc-go"><a href="#explorer-take-road">Go on at vi · Places on the chart</a></p></div>","caption":"Every room that teaches, and how far you have come: a red seal is a lesson done, a red rim one begun, the red road is the way you have come; the lit room is the one you are reading, and the hand points at your next step.","seat":"head","cardLeft":"0","cardTop":"0","foldWidth":"52rem"};
  if (P.seat === "none") return "none";
