i class="none"><span class="cc-n">viii</span><a href="#explorer-table">The Chart Table</a><em>0 of 4</em></li></ol><p class="cc-go"><a href="#explorer-take-road">Go on at vi · Places on the chart</a></p></div>","caption":"Every room that teaches, and how far you have come: a red seal is a lesson done, a red rim one begun, the red road is the way you have come; the lit room is the one you are reading, and the hand points at your next step.","seat":"head","cardLeft":"0","cardTop":"0","foldWidth":"50rem"};
  if (P.seat === "none") return "none";
